Example 1:

3
00:00:17,839 --> 00:00:28,666
Compare 8.1 m and 7.9 m

4
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:36,866
To compare we do as follows.

5
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:57,500
Convert to unit dm Using comparison of natural numbers.

6
00:00:59,666 --> 00:01:18,330
Fill: 8.1 m = 81 dm; 7.9 m = 79 dm

7
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:37,366
81 dm > 79 dm (81 > 79 because at tens place 8 > 7)

8
00:01:39,666 --> 00:01:49,100
That is 8.1 m > 7.9 m.

9
00:01:51,566 --> 00:02:05,600
So 8.1 > 7.9 (whole part has 8 > 7)

